      <summary><span class="badge high">HIGH</span> Case Study Template Lacks Machine-Extractable Proof <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-secondary); font-weight: 400;">(SCH-004 &mdash; Trust angle)</span></summary>
      <div class="finding-content">
        <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;">This is the same underlying gap flagged in UNDERSTAND (<a href="#SCH-004">SCH-004</a>), viewed through the trust lens. An AI model choosing between Marq and a competitor weights <em>verifiable</em> proof: customer name in schema, industry label, numeric outcome, review rating. Prose-only case studies can be read but cannot be cited in structured form &mdash; and an AI that cannot cite will hedge.</p>

