            <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;">All 16 case studies render customer logos, names, and testimonial quotes in HTML but emit zero Article / CaseStudy / Review schema. No about.Organization for the customer. No reviewRating. No result field carrying numeric outcomes. Trust side-effect: when Claude or GPT is asked "which brand-marketing teams have shipped faster with Marq," the model cannot produce a cited list. The evidence exists on the site; the citation surface does not.</p>

